        <div class='list-comments mathjax'><span class='descriptor'>Comments:</span>
          This paper accepted by ICDM 2025 proposes OTESGN for ABSA, fusing syntactic-semantic signals via optimal transport and attention mechanisms. It achieves SOTA on Rest14, Laptop14 and Twitter (up to +1.30 Macro-F1 on Laptop14), with strong noise suppression and fine-grained sentiment capture capabilities. <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11392054" rel="external noopener nofollow" class="link-external link-https">this https URL</a>
